  "prefLabel": "Rev 3401.15 Shade and ornamental trees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 3401.15 “Shade and ornamental trees” means trees that are within striking distance of a maintained permanent structure and that are solely maintained by the owner for shade or ornamental purposes.\n\nSource. #10664, eff 9-4-14; ss by #14026, eff 7-16-24 (formerly Rev 3401.16)",
